[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - This kernel computes an inclusive cumulative sum along dim=1 for a 2D float32 CUDA tensor.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - It uses two passes:
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - Pass 1: blockwise serial scan writing to out and recording block sums.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - Pass 2: exclusive scan of block sums and add to out blocks.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Avoids Python lists and Python scalar indexing inside the kernel; uses only Triton tensor ops.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Falls back to torch.cumsum for CPU, non-2D, wrong dim, or non-float32.
