[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Support float16/bfloat16 by loading as half, accumulating in float32, casting back.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Tune BLOCK and num_warps for your GPU.
