[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m Why consider a Triton kernel
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - torch.matmul will use cuBLAS which is extremely optimized; beating cuBLAS in general is hard.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - However, Triton allows:
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - Custom tiling and layouts
