[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m Performance considerations
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - cuBLAS is highly optimized; for many shapes it may outperform custom kernels. The Triton kernel here is meant to demonstrate fusion and control over tiling without materializing transposes.
