[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 4) Kernel design
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Compute C = A^T @ B, where A is (K, M), B is (K, N), C is (M, N).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Tile C into blocks of size BLOCK_M x BLOCK_N. Loop over K in steps of BLOCK_K, load A and B tiles, accumulate acc += dot(a, b).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Stride-aware: pass A.stride(0), A.stride(1), B.stride(0), B.stride(1), C.stride(0), C.stride(1) to support non-contiguous.
