[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Provide a clean CPU fallback: if tensor is not CUDA, use torch.clamp and torch.add.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Keep the API identical: class name ModelNew, constructor signature matching, forward(x) returns same shape/dtype.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Document limitations: this version accelerates elementwise ops with Triton; major speedups would require custom convolution kernels (depthwise and 1x1), which are substantial engineering efforts.
