[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Performance and correctness of the kernels:
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - The previous version fused mean+add+softmax in three passes over channels (max, sum, write). That’s correct but memory-inefficient (reads x 3 times).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - We can reduce to two passes by using a “online” log-sum-exp merge:
