[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m     - Pass 2: recompute mean+add z, then write softmax = exp(z - m)/s.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - This keeps numerical stability and reads x only twice.
