[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - With get_init_inputs() returning dim=1 and get_inputs() returning a list with a single tensor shaped (32768, 32768), the effective operation is a cumulative sum along the second dimension (dim=1) for each of the 32768 rows.
