[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - It builds an MBConv-like block:
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - expand_conv: 1x1 Conv2d that increases channels from Cin -> Hidden = Cin * expand_ratio, then BN + ReLU6.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - depthwise_conv: depthwise Conv2d (kernel_size x kernel_size, groups=Hidden) on Hidden channels, then BN + ReLU6.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - project_conv: 1x1 Conv2d that reduces Hidden -> Cout, then BN.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - Residual: x += identity at the very end (post project), only if stride == 1 and in_channels == out_channels.
