[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Use float32 throughout for simplicity and numerical stability.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Respect NCHW strides; pass strides to kernels.
