[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - Result C = (M, K) @ (K, N) => shape (M, N).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m   - So this is a standard GEMM: C[m, n] = sum_{k=0..K-1} A.T[m, k] * B[k, n] = sum_{k} A[k, m] * B[k, n].
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 
