[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 2) Where to optimize with Triton
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m The sequence mean -> add -> softmax -> tanh -> scale is ideal for fusion into a single GPU kernel:
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - One program per spatial position (b, h, w).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Loop over channels in blocks to compute:
