[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m     BT_ptr = BT + (offs_k[:, None] * stride_bk + offs_n[None, :] * stride_bn)  # [BK, BN]
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 
