[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Correctness: The kernel computes sum over k of A[k, i] * B[k, j], which equals (A^T @ B)[i, j]. Masking handles edge tiles; accumulation is in float32.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Dtype: Limited to float32 for simplicity. If you need fp16/bf16, you can extend by loading as half, casting to float32 for accumulation, then casting back on store. For now, non-fp32 falls back to torch.matmul.
