[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m # Fused kernel: mean over depth + bias add + softmax (over channels) + tanh + scale
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m # Assumes input after conv-transpose is contiguous NCDHW.
