[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 3) Memory layout and indexing
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Tensors are assumed contiguous in NCHWD layout by default in PyTorch. Strides: x.stride() returns (sN, sC, sD, sH, sW).
