[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Softmax kernel: grid over (B*H*W) programs; each program handles one vector of length C at fixed (b,h,w). Load C values x[b, :, 0, h, w], compute max, exp, sum, normalize.
