[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 4) Numeric considerations
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Accumulate in float32 for mean to improve precision (even if input is float16).
