[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 5) Fusing opportunities and trade-offs
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - We could fuse mean + bias into one kernel (compute mean, add bias, store). That saves one read+write but given the small sizes it’s marginal.
