[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m Notes
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - This change keeps the heavy GEMM in torch (fastest available) and fuses the two elementwise ops into a single, bandwidth-efficient pass.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - It is simple, correct, and should compile/run reliably.
