[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Keep GEMM in torch (fastest).
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Remove the extra elementwise pass by fusing the post-op into the GEMM epilogue: y = A@B + alpha*b, where alpha = 1 + scaling_factor.
