[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m 8) Edge cases and fallbacks
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - If tensors are on CPU, use torch.matmul.
[36m(MultiTurnAsyncvLLMEngine pid=1400823)[0m - Ensure shapes are as expected; assert K dimension matches.
